874 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We began with the belief that knowing preferences before arrival would help prepare a room that felt like home\056 That position made preference collection appear to be the central design problem\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 875 0 R
     /Pg 864 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
