  << /K [ 878 0 R ]
     /P 916 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 864 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

880 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The supplied GXP deck also prevents an \215MO has no process\216 conclusion\056 It documents existing information categories and traces\056 This case study now describes our proposal as building on that foundation and gives the narrower claims explicit limits\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 881 0 R
     /Pg 864 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
