884 0 obj
  << /ActualText (At Shenzhen MO\054 the Dream Maker role suggested that relevant needs could emerge in a conversation or situation that a pre\055arrival form could never fully predict\056 We widened the service from a collection interface to a relationship between preparation\054 observation and response\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 885 0 R
     /Pg 864 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
